  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's unclear to users that blocking someone, kicking someone, or muting someone can lead that user into getting a nuisance rank. Most vrchat users do not know that it can lead to that, and will often do it in jest or for fun. There should be a clear warning that these actions can lead to the  user's degradation of their experience.  Also, users who have not obtained the rank of User should not be able to take actions that can lead to someone earning a Nuisance rank, as a flood of new users could, potentially, harass a user and lead to them earning that rank.  \nThere should be a system in place to identify abuse of the system.",
